  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN Master in Sustainability Management Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: Building on a close collaboration with leading private businesses and government agencies on coursework, internships, and thesis research, students will, after graduation, be able to contribute to a more sustainable, resilient, and inclusive ASEAN who can integrate sustainability principles into public policy, private enterprise, and community development through regionally grounded and globally informed education.

Objective: A new generation of ASEAN leaders is equipped to drive sustainability transformation in business, government, and civil society across the region.

Target group: Qualified university students from ODA-eligible ASEAN Member States.</narrative>
  </description>
